# AI Orchestration — Phase 1 (function calling + confirmation gate)
#
# @host is the ai-orchestration URL. Under Aspire, copy it from the dashboard
# (the "ai-orchestration" resource endpoint). Standalone: use your launch URL.
@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. A read — runs immediately, no confirmation
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Find me a catalog in Da Nang"
}

### 2. A write — the assistant PREPARES a booking and returns a proposal.
# Capture `conversationId` and `proposal.proposalId` from the response.
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "REPLACE_WITH_conversationId",
  "message": "Book catalog 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6 from tomorrow for 2 nights"
}

### 3. Confirm the proposal — only now does it hit the booking API
POST {{host}}/chat/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "REPLACE_WITH_conversationId",
  "proposalId": "REPLACE_WITH_proposalId",
  "approve": true
}
